2. TIMETABLE AND STOP DATA (site/ and bus-build/places-manifest.json)

Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0:
https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

  - Bus timetables: Bus Open Data Service (BODS), Department for Transport.
  - Bus stop codes and locations: NaPTAN, Department for Transport.

These files are compiled and reorganised from those sources. Their use is not
endorsed by the Department for Transport or any bus operator. Always check
times with the operator before you travel.


3. NO WARRANTY

The data is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Timetables change,
buses are cancelled and the data may be wrong or out of date. Fellgorithm is a
planner, not a navigation or safety device.
